---Serializer for a BatchExportRun model.
---@class posthog.batch_exports.BatchExportRun
---@field id? string
---@field data_interval_end? string The end of the data interval.
---@field status? posthog.batch_exports.BatchExportRunStatusEnum The status of this run. * `Cancelled` - Cancelled * `Completed` - Completed * `ContinuedAsNew` - Continued As New * `Failed` - Failed * `FailedRetryable` - Failed Retryable * `FailedBilling` - Failed Billing * `Terminated` - Terminated * `TimedOut` - Timedout * `Running` - Running * `Starting` - Starting
---@field records_completed? number|distilled.Null The number of records that have been exported.
---@field records_failed? number|distilled.Null The number of records that failed downstream processing (e.g. hog function execution errors).
---@field latest_error? string|distilled.Null The latest error that occurred during this run.
---@field data_interval_start? string|distilled.Null The start of the data interval.
---@field cursor? string|distilled.Null An opaque cursor that may be used to resume.
---@field created_at? string The timestamp at which this BatchExportRun was created.
---@field finished_at? string|distilled.Null The timestamp at which this BatchExportRun finished, successfully or not.
---@field last_updated_at? string The timestamp at which this BatchExportRun was last updated.
---@field records_total_count? number|distilled.Null The total count of records that should be exported in this BatchExportRun.
---@field bytes_exported? number|distilled.Null The number of bytes that have been exported in this BatchExportRun.
---@field batch_export? string|distilled.Null The `BatchExport` this run belongs to.
---@field batch_export_on_demand? string|distilled.Null The `BatchExportOnDemand` this run belongs to.
---@field backfill? string|distilled.Null The backfill this run belongs to.

---* `Cancelled` - Cancelled
---* `Completed` - Completed
---* `ContinuedAsNew` - Continued As New
---* `Failed` - Failed
---* `FailedRetryable` - Failed Retryable
---* `FailedBilling` - Failed Billing
---* `Terminated` - Terminated
---* `TimedOut` - Timedout
---* `Running` - Running
---* `Starting` - Starting
---@alias posthog.batch_exports.BatchExportRunStatusEnum "Cancelled"|"Completed"|"ContinuedAsNew"|"Failed"|"FailedRetryable"|"FailedBilling"|"Terminated"|"TimedOut"|"Running"|"Starting"

---@class posthog.batch_exports.BatchExportsBackfillsCancelCreateRequest
---@field project_id string Project ID of the project you're trying to access. To find the ID of the project, make a call to /api/projects/.
---@field batch_export_id string The BatchExport this backfill belongs to.
